    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>You didn't let anyone back you down or tell you what to do when you were alive. Damned if you're going to let death stop you. You are a zealot for the anarch cause&mdash;you've seen the rotting shell of the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.fc464242d84d4e34]{Camarilla}, and you know in your heart that it has to come down. You're not quite sure what being a vampire is all about yet&mdash;things like \"immortality\" still haven't sunk in. After 20 years you'll either be just like the Weary Anarch, or you'll be ash on the wind. But right now, you live for the moment and the cause. Give your every waking moment to making sure the Anarch movement rolls into the millennium like a freight train. There's nothing sweeter than freedom. Never let it go.</p><h2>Stat Block (as printed)</h2><p><strong>Clan:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.ZFYurbvAHfaRguYI]{Brujah}<br><strong>Nature:</strong> Rebel<br><strong>Demeanor:</strong> Visionary<br><strong>Generation:</strong> 13th</p><p><strong>Physical (10):</strong> Brawny x3, Quick x4, Tough x3<br><strong>Social (9):</strong> Expressive x3, Magnetic x3, Persuasive x3<br><strong>Mental (8):</strong> Cunning x3, Dedicated x3, Determined x2, Violent (N)</p><p><strong>Abilities:</strong> Brawl 2, Firearms 2, Leadership 3</p><p><strong>Disciplines:</strong> Celerity (Alacrity, Swiftness); Potence (Prowess); Presence (Awe)</p><p><strong>Backgrounds:</strong> Influence: Street x2<br><strong>Virtues:</strong> Conscience 4, Self-Control 3, Courage 4<br><strong>Path:</strong> Humanity 4<br><strong>@UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.rules-reference.JournalEntry.St7uVm2DqK4nRy8X]{Status} (0):</strong> None<br><strong>Blood:</strong> 10 (may spend 1/round)<br><strong>Willpower:</strong> 6</p>",
    "notes": "",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
